#. 【お願い】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[favor]"
msgstr "[nhờ vả]"

#. お願いって…何？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A favor? What is it...?"
msgstr ""

#. こんな事を頼むなんて、
#. 筋違いなのはわかってる…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I know it's completely unreasonable to ask you this."
msgstr ""

#. きっと迷惑なのもわかってる…
#. でもね…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And I know it'll only inconvenience you that much\n"
"more. But..."
msgstr ""

#. …ここから出て行ってくれない？
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...could you leave?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hả?"

#. 少し…ほんの少しの間でいいから…
#. １人にして欲しいの…
msgctxt "0007 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Just for a little while. I'd just...like to be alone\n"
"for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. き、霧切さん…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "K-Kyoko..."
msgstr ""

#. 心配しなくても、大丈夫よ…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Don't worry, I'm fine."
msgstr ""

#. ただ…少し冷静になりたいだけ…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I just need to calm down a little..."
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと…気持ちを整理する時間が欲しいだけ…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I need to...get my emotions in order."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あのさ、霧切さん…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You know, Kyoko..."
msgstr ""

#. 前に、霧切さんは、
#. お父さんとの関係について言ってたよね？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You told me before about the relationship you had with\n"
"your dad."
msgstr ""

#. 血が繋がってるだけで、
#. 心は繋がってないって…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"How you're only connected by blood, not by heart and\n"
"soul."
msgstr ""

#. で、でもさ…
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼は、あの写真を励みにしながら仕事に打ち込み、
#. いつか私に会いに来ようと思っていたのかも…
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Maybe that picture motivated him, maybe he hoped to\n"
"see me again someday."
msgstr ""

#. …そんな風に思ったりした？
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Is that what you were going to say?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あなたの言ってる事は、
#. 正論かもしれないけど…
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If so, it's just a theory."
msgstr ""

#. でも、正論じゃ片付かないのよ…
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And this isn't an issue that can be settled with\n"
"theories."
msgstr ""

#. こんな写真だけで…
#. 私の“今まで”が変わる訳じゃない…
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That picture doesn't change the facts of what\n"
"happened, what I went through."
msgstr ""

#. そう簡単に…割り切れないのよ…
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That problem can't be solved so easily."
msgstr ""

#. そう…だよね…
#. ごめん…
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're right... I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#. …気持ちを落ちつけたら、
#. すぐに捜査に戻るわ。
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Once I've got myself under control, I'll return to the\n"
"investigation immediately."
msgstr ""

#. だから、少しだけ１人にして置いて…
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So please, just give me some time to myself."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…わかったよ…
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay, I understand."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…先に行ってるね…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then...I'll see you later."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ね、ねぇ…霧切さん……
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hey, Kyoko...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女は、ボクの方を見ようともしなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I may as well not even have been in the room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女の視線は、
#. ただ、ある１点に注がれていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Her gaze was fixed on only one thing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>プレゼント…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A present...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな楽しげな包装をされた箱…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wrapped and covered with such joy...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それゆえに奇妙な箱…だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's what made it so unusual...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0037 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは、あの奇妙な箱を
#. じっと見つめている。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She was right, it *was* unusual. And she couldn't stop\n"
"looking at it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まるで、睨みつけるような視線で…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, not just looking—glaring.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 想像通りって…
#. どうして…想像が付くの…？
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Just as you thought...? How could you have known that?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…こんな箱に…
#. 人の骨が入ってるなんて…！
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I mean...there were bones in there! Human bones!"
msgstr ""

#. 私が想像していたのは、
#. 骨が入っている事じゃなくて…
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Well, it's not that I was thinking of the bones\n"
"specifically."
msgstr ""

#. 死体が入っているって事よ。
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I just...had a feeling it would be his body."
msgstr ""

#. い、一緒だよ！
#. こんな箱の中に…死体が…！
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Th-That's pretty much the same thing! A dead guy in a\n"
"box!"
msgstr ""

#. 私の父よ…
msgctxt "0045 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "My father..."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hả?"

#. …な、何が？
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What about him?"
msgstr ""

#. その箱の中身よ…
msgctxt "0048 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What you found in the box..."
msgstr ""

#. その箱に入っている骨…
msgctxt "0049 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Those bones..."
msgstr ""

#. その…死体……
msgctxt "0050 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That...body..."
msgstr ""

#. それが…私の父よ…
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's my father."
msgstr ""

#. 私の父の…なれの果て…
msgctxt "0052 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Or at least...what's left of him."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな…！
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A-Are you serious!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これが…霧切さんのお父さん…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is...Kyoko's dad?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが捜してた…お父さんだって…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The same man she's been searching for...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと待ってよ！
#. どうしてわかるの…？
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hold on! How can you know that for sure?"
msgstr ""

#. どうして、これが…
#. 霧切さんのお父さんだって…
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "How do you know...that's him?"
msgstr ""

#. 今までの情報を合わせて考えてみれば、
#. 答えはそれしかないじゃない…
msgctxt "0058 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Given all the information we have already, that's the\n"
"only possible answer."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、すべてを仕組んだ黒幕は、
#. その学園長って可能性が高いんだ。
msgctxt "0059 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"So that same person may very well be the mastermind\n"
"who planned all this out."
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、その学園長は３０代後半の男性で…
msgctxt "0060 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"And according to the files, the headmaster is a man\n"
"in his late thirties."
msgstr ""

#. 今も…<CLT 3>この学園内にいる<CLT>可能性が高いみたいだよ…
msgctxt "0061 | ALTER EGO"
msgid ""
"It seems possible, even likely, that he's <CLT 3>somewhere\n"
"in this school<CLT> right now."
msgstr ""

#. クックック…
#. むしろ、ついでにヒントをもう１つやるクマ…
msgctxt "0062 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Kehehe... It's a very polarizing approach, I know,\n"
"but—okay, enough puns. Anyway, here's a hint..."
msgstr ""

#. 確か、前にも言ったと思うクマ…
msgctxt "0063 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I'm sure I told you this already, but..."
msgstr ""

#. この<CLT 3>“コロシアイ学園生活”<CLT>の参加者は、
#. 全部で１６人の高校生だけだって…
msgctxt "0064 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...this <CLT 3>killing game<CLT> began with sixteen\n"
"participants, all of them high school students."
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、コロシアイ学園生活が始まった後、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園に生きたまま足を踏み入れた人間も…
msgctxt "0065 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And the only people to take a single step in Hope's\n"
"Peak since the killing game began..."
msgstr ""

#. その１６人だけだったクマ。
msgctxt "0066 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...are those sixteen students."
msgstr ""

#. 学園長はこの学園にいる可能性が高い。
#. だけど…
msgctxt "0067 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Alter Ego said that the headmaster was probably here\n"
"in the school..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“生きたまま”<CLT>希望ヶ峰学園に足を踏み入れたのは、
#. 私達１６人の高校生だけ…
msgctxt "0068 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...but the only ones who were <CLT 3>alive<CLT> at the start of\n"
"the killing game were us sixteen students."
msgstr ""

#. それらを合わせて考えてみれば…
msgctxt "0069 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"When you put those two ideas together, it doesn't take\n"
"much to assume..."
msgstr ""

#. 私の父は<CLT 3>“死んだ状態”<CLT>で、
#. この学園にいる可能性が高い…
msgctxt "0070 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...that most likely, my father *was* in this school,\n"
"but he was also <CLT 3>dead<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …そうなるはずよ。
msgctxt "0071 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's my assumption, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは冷静な口調で、
#. そう分析していた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As Kyoko explained her analysis, she was completely\n"
"calm.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、冷静な口調なんかじゃない。
#. それは、明らかに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Or, no...she *wasn't* calm.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>“冷静を装った口調”<CLT><CLT 4>だった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She was only <CLT><CLT 3>trying to *seem* calm<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>想像通り…想像していた…
#. 霧切さんはそう言ってたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She said it was just as she thought. So she knew it\n"
"was a possibility.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、その想像が裏切られる事を、
#. どこかで期待してたはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I have to believe that at some point, she wanted\n"
"to be proven wrong.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから、彼女は、
#. １度も箱の中を見ようとしないんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which is why she never looked in the box herself, even\n"
"though she had plenty of chances.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そもそも、霧切さんは過去を清算する為に、
#. お父さんに会いに来たって言ってたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I know Kyoko said she wanted to see her father so she\n"
"could cut off all ties.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、あの霧切さんが、
#. たったそれだけの為に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But was that all there was to it?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 私は…その誇りを曲げてしまった…
msgctxt "0080 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I...gave up some of that pride."
msgstr ""

#. 私は、この希望ヶ峰学園に入学する為に、
#. 学園側に自分を売り込んだの…
msgctxt "0081 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"In order to enter Hope's Peak, I had to reveal myself\n"
"to the school."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切家の探偵として、
#. あるまじき行為と知りつつね…
msgctxt "0082 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I did it knowing it was something a true Kirigiri\n"
"detective would never do."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>たったそれだけの為に…
#. 彼女が自分の誇りを曲げるはずがない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Would she really give up her pride just for that?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…ボクには、そう思えて仕方がなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I couldn't help but wonder...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>隠し部屋のプレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Hidden Room Present<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0086 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ねぇ、苗木君…聞いてもらえる？
msgctxt "0087 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Listen, Makoto...?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hả?"

#. ちょっと<CLT 1>【お願い】<CLT>があるの…
msgctxt "0089 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Can I ask you a <CLT 1>[favor]<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんのお願いって…
#. なんの事だ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A favor? Sure, what is it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0091 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>無闇に話しかけられる…雰囲気じゃないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I feel like I shouldn't make pointless small talk\n"
"right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>先に…この部屋の事を調べておくか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should just look around a bit first.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>殺風景な部屋に相応しくない…
#. 妙に楽しげな包装の箱…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a brightly colored box here. It seems totally\n"
"out of place in here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>見れば見るほど怪しい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The more I look at it, the more suspicious I get.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、開けても大丈夫なのかな…？
#. なんだか…嫌な予感がするけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Should we open it? I'm getting kind of a bad vibe from\n"
"it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、開けない訳にも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I mean, we can't *not* open it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. よ、よし…！
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay!"
msgstr ""

#. …苗木君、気を付けてね。
msgctxt "0099 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Be careful, Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、危険だよね！？
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Why, you think it's dangerous!?"
msgstr ""

#. 危険はないと思うけど…
msgctxt "0101 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No, not dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. ただ、きっと驚くでしょうね。
msgctxt "0102 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But...surprising, probably."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. 私の予想だと、中に入ってるのは…
msgctxt "0104 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "If it is what I think it is..."
msgstr ""

#. 少なくとも、見て楽しい物ではないはずよ。
msgctxt "0105 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...at the very least, it's not something you'll be\n"
"happy to see."
msgstr ""

#. むしろ…予想出来るの…？
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait, so...you know what's in there?"
msgstr ""

#. …叫んだりしないでね。
msgctxt "0107 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Just don't scream or anything, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さ、叫ぶほどの物…って事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A-Are you saying...it's something that'll make me\n"
"*want* to scream?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0109 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. と、とにかく！　開けてみるね！
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay, I'm just gonna open it!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは箱の前まで、
#. 一気に歩みを進めると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Step by heavy step, I approached the box.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>よし、と心の中で自分に言い聞かせた後、
#. そっと、ふたに手を掛け…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I took a deep breath, then took hold of the lid.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ゆっくり…ゆっくりと…
#. 慎重にそれを持ち上げていく……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Slowly, ever so slowly, I lifted it up...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>箱の内部に徐々に光が差し込んでいき、
#. そして、ボクは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Light began to sneak its way into the box.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>中を…そっと覗き込み……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I stole a hesitant glance inside, and...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. う……
msgctxt "0116 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Gh..."
msgstr "Ư..."

#. うわぁああああああッ！！
msgctxt "0117 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Guwaaaaaaaahhh!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの助言もむなしく、
#. ボクは叫び声を上げていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0118 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko's advice was no use. I let out a trembling cry.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>骨だった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0119 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What was in the box...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その箱の中身は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0120 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was bones.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>人の骨…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0121 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Human bones...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>楽しげな包装をされた箱からは、
#. 想像も付かなかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0122 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was the last thing I expected to find in such a\n"
"bright, joyful box.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>当たり前だ…そんな想像が付く訳…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0123 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, who could have possibly imagined...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …想像通りだったわね。
msgctxt "0124 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Just as I thought."
msgstr "Quả đúng như tôi nghĩ."

#. え……？
msgctxt "0125 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>箱の中身は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0126 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What was in the box...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>プレゼント風の楽しげな包装をされたからは、
#. 想像も付かなかった物…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0127 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was wrapped up all nice, so I never would have\n"
"guessed what was inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>人の…骨だ…！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0128 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Human bones...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>箱の中身は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0129 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What was in the box...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>プレゼント風の楽しげな包装をされたからは、
#. 想像も付かなかった物…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was wrapped up all nice, so I never would have\n"
"guessed what was inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>人の…骨…！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Human bones...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ、この写真って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? This picture...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>色あせてるし…
#. かなり古い写真みたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's all faded. It must be pretty old.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかして、ここに写ってるのって…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0134 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wait, is this a picture of...!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ね、ねぇ…霧切さん…！
msgctxt "0135 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hey, Kyoko...!"
msgstr ""

#. …ッ！！
msgctxt "0136 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...!"
msgstr "...!"

#. ………………
msgctxt "0137 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 本当に…迷惑な話よね……
msgctxt "0138 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well, this is annoying."
msgstr ""

#. 過去を清算する為に、
#. わざわざ…こんな所まで来たって言うのに…
msgctxt "0139 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I came here to cut myself free of the past."
msgstr ""

#. それ…なのに……
msgctxt "0140 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And yet..."
msgstr "Thế nhưng..."

#. 今更、こんな物を見せられて…
msgctxt "0141 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "To now find something like this..."
msgstr ""

#. それで…どうしろって言うのよ……
msgctxt "0142 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So what do you expect me to do now...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、そうだったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0143 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then I was right.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この写真って、霧切さんが子供の頃の…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0144 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a picture of Kyoko when she was a little girl.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、そんな写真を、
#. ずっと持っているって事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0145 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Knowing the headmaster had this picture all this\n"
"time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと学園長は…
#. ずっと…霧切さんの事を……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0146 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He must have really cared about her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なぜ…？　どうしてなの…？
msgctxt "0147 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Why? What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 今度こそ、私の人生から切り離せるって…
#. 捨てられたなんて過去を清算できるって……
msgctxt "0148 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I wanted to face him and tell him myself. To cut him\n"
"out of my life for abandoning me..."
msgstr ""

#. その為に…わざわざ会いに来たって言うのに…
msgctxt "0149 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's the whole reason I came here."
msgstr ""

#. また勝手に…いなくなって……
msgctxt "0150 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And now he's abandoned me again."
msgstr ""

#. 私から“忘れる”機会さえ奪って…
msgctxt "0151 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And this time, he even stole the only opportunity I\n"
"had to move on."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…最低の父親……
msgctxt "0152 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Has there ever been a worse father...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切…さん……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0153 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>霧切と学園長の写真<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0154 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Photo of Kyoko and Headmaster<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to\n"
"the Truth Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0155 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ねぇ、苗木君…聞いてもらえる？
msgctxt "0156 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Listen, Makoto...?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0157 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hả?"

#. ちょっと<CLT 1>【お願い】<CLT>があるの…
msgctxt "0158 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Can I ask you a <CLT 1>[favor]<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>お願い…？
#. しかも、このタイミングって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0159 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A favor? Now?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この写真…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0160 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This picture...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんが子供の頃の…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0161 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's from when Kyoko was a little girl.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、そんな写真を、
#. ずっと持っているって事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0162 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Knowing the headmaster had this picture all this\n"
"time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>きっと学園長は…霧切さんの事を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0163 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He must have really cared about her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…迷惑な話よね…
msgctxt "0164 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well, this is annoying."
msgstr ""

#. 過去を清算する為に、
#. わざわざ、こんな所まで来たって言うのに…
msgctxt "0165 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I came here to cut myself free of the past."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切…さん……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0166 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの想像通りって言葉…
#. その意味を確認しないと…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0167 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko said, \"Just as I thought.\" I have to find out\n"
"what she meant by that...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…それよりも先に…
#. あの怪しいプレゼントを確認した方がいいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0168 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better check out that suspicious present before I\n"
"do anything...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園長のデスクか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0169 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The headmaster's desk...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いかにも手掛かりがありそうだし、
#. 詳しく調べておきたいところだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0170 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's probably hiding some kind of clue, so I really\n"
"want to check it out, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんのお父さんのデスクを、
#. ボクが勝手にって言うのもな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0171 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I really don't want to touch Kyoko's dad's desk\n"
"without her permission.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …私の事なら気にしないで、
#. 好きに調べれば？
msgctxt "0172 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Don't worry about me. Feel free to look around as much\n"
"as you like."
msgstr ""

#. …いいの？
msgctxt "0173 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "Cậu chắc chứ?"

#. あなたの捜査を止める権利なんて、
#. どこにもないはずよ？
msgctxt "0174 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Never let anything get in the way of the\n"
"investigation. I don't."
msgstr ""

#. じゃ、じゃあ…
#. そうさせてもらうね…
msgctxt "0175 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay, then...if you don't mind..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、デスクの引き出しを上から順番に開け、
#. 中を確認していった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0176 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Starting from the top, I opened all the desk drawers\n"
"and looked inside.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どの引き出しに入っているのも、
#. 仕事の資料ばかり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0177 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I rummaged through each one, finding nothing but\n"
"unrelated documents.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、１番下の引き出しには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0178 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But in the last drawer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あ、これって…
msgctxt "0179 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? Is this...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>電子生徒手帳…だよな？
#. しかも、緊急用って書いてある…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0180 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...an e-Handbook, right? And it has a label on it\n"
"that says \"in case of emergency\"...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園長のデスクの中にあった、
#. 緊急用の電子生徒手帳…って事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0181 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd found some kind of emergency handbook in the\n"
"headmaster's desk.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 学園長権限が与えられた電子生徒手帳…
#. <CLT 3>制限のないオールマイティーな電子生徒手帳<CLT>…
msgctxt "0182 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"A <CLT 3>handbook with no limitations<CLT>, given to the\n"
"school's ultimate authority, the headmaster..."
msgstr ""

#. …そう考えられるわね。
msgctxt "0183 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm assuming that's what that is."
msgstr ""

#. やっぱ…そうだよね…
msgctxt "0184 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I think you're probably right."
msgstr ""

#. 今後の捜査の役にも立ちそうね…
msgctxt "0185 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It might prove useful as we continue our\n"
"investigation."
msgstr ""

#. …持っていけば？
msgctxt "0186 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Why don't you hold on to it?"
msgstr ""

#. え、でも霧切さんが…
msgctxt "0187 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? But Kyoko..."
msgstr ""

#. …私は必要ない。
#. あなたがいらないなら置いて行けばいいだけよ。
msgctxt "0188 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I don't need it. If you don't want it, go ahead and\n"
"leave it here."
msgstr ""

#. だ、だったら…
#. 預からせてもらうけど…
msgctxt "0189 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-Then...I guess I'll take it."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0190 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>本当に…いいんだよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0191 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is it...really okay?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>学園長の電子生徒手帳<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0192 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Headmaster's e-Handbook<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the\n"
"Truth Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0193 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ねぇ、苗木君…聞いてもらえる？
msgctxt "0194 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Listen, Makoto...?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0195 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Hả?"

#. ちょっと<CLT 1>【お願い】<CLT>があるの…
msgctxt "0196 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Can I ask you a <CLT 1>[favor]<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>お願い…？
#. しかも、このタイミングって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0197 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A favor? Now?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>他に…手掛かりになりそうな物はないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0198 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think there are any more clues here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの想像通りって言葉…
#. その意味を確認しないと…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0199 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko said, \"Just as I thought.\" I have to find out\n"
"what she meant by that...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…それよりも先に…
#. あの怪しいプレゼントを確認した方がいいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0200 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better check out that suspicious present before I\n"
"do anything...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この棚…手掛かりがありそうな雰囲気だな。
#. 詳しく調べておきたいところだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0201 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This filing cabinet seems like the kind of place you'd\n"
"find a clue. I should take a closer look...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>さすがに、他人のボクが、
#. 霧切さんのお父さんの棚を勝手にって訳にも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0202 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I don't think Kyoko would like some stranger like\n"
"me touching her dad's stuff.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0203 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 私の事なら気にしないでいいわよ。
#. 好きに調べれば…
msgctxt "0204 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's fine. Check whatever you want."
msgstr ""

#. …いいの？
msgctxt "0205 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are you sure...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0206 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. じゃ、じゃあ…
#. そうさせてもらうね…
msgctxt "0207 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "O-Okay then..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>棚の引き出しを上から順番に開け、
#. 中を確認していく。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0208 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I went through each drawer one by one, starting from\n"
"the top.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、どの引き出しにあるのも、
#. 仕事の資料ばかりだった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0209 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But all I found were piles and piles of unrelated\n"
"documents...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 随分…仕事熱心な人だったんだね…
msgctxt "0210 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "He was pretty dedicated to his job, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 後がなかっただけよ…
msgctxt "0211 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "It's just because he didn't have anything else."
msgstr ""

#. 家業を継ぐのが嫌で、
#. 家を飛び出した立場なんだし…
msgctxt "0212 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"He could have inherited our family business, our\n"
"legacy. Instead, he left it all behind."
msgstr ""

#. もし、この仕事でつまづくようなら、
#. 本当に、ただの落ちこぼれじゃない。
msgctxt "0213 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If he couldn't even handle a job like this, he would\n"
"have been that much more of a failure."
msgstr ""

#. それが嫌で、必死になってただけよ…
msgctxt "0214 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I'm sure he couldn't stand the thought of that, and it\n"
"made him desperate."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0215 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>この棚には…手掛かりはないみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0216 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like the cabinet isn't hiding any clues.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんの想像通りって言葉…
#. その意味を確認しないと…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0217 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko said, \"Just as I thought.\" I have to find out\n"
"what she meant by that...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…それよりも先に…
#. あの怪しいプレゼントを確認した方がいいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0218 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better check out that suspicious present before I\n"
"do anything...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ…調べなきゃいけない事があるよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0219 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to look around a little more, I think...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
